# CPanel supervisor read directory

Authority: `docs/platforms/cpanel/customer-management.md`. Workflow: `.cursor/skills/cpanel-supervisor-read-directory/SKILL.md`.

## Routes

- `supervisorRouter`, `SUPERVISOR_MAIN`, `mustAuthedAs: ["SUPERVISOR"]`.
- Static path before parametric `:id` on the same prefix.
- Href params nested: `MPagesRoutes.X: { params: { id: string } }` — never a flat `id` on the route type.
- Thin `MyPage`; screens under `components/supervisor/<module>/`.
- Drawer: `alwaysAvailable` tile after Home when the module is first-class; keep Home `HomeMark`.

## Adapters

- Inherit `DATA_ADAPTERS.SUPERVISOR_GQL`. Do not add `DATA_ADAPTERS` or `Forms` keys for the module.
- List: stable mount-private identify; `{ gql, listable, filter }`; records + extras on `section`.
- Detail: omit `adapterIdentify` (`GenerateIdentify`); no `listable`; read `section.<root>`.
- Default `removeOnExit` → leaving the page drops the slot; remount reloads.
- History search: `useWithHistoryState` + Enter; GQL filter only — no client-side list filter.

## UI

- Directories: `ResultLane` + card-shaped `renderSkeleton`. Not `DataTable`.
- Detail loading: `Loadable` `3rem` via `PageStateLane`. Not card bones. Identity heading is **inside** success children.
- Forms: import `FormStateLane` (alias of `PageStateLane`). Heading and submit/delete stay **outside** the lane.
- Overlay contract: `docs/platforms/cpanel/supervisor-state-lanes.md`.
- Do not add props to `Empty` / `LaneFailed` / `Loadable`. Detail overlay has no heading. Host: padded `Col flx_1`, lane `relative` `flx_1`. Layout content must be a flex `Col` so `flx_1` fills; detail screen `FlexContainer dir="column" flx_1`.
- Overlay flags belong on the hook (`showEmpty` = `LOADED_WITH_ERRORS` && missing record). Screen consumes flags only.
- Directory KPIs: shared `Stats` bound to that module’s `*Stats` extras (customers: `customerStats`; meetings: `meetingStats`; plans: `planStats`; subscriptions: `subscriptionStats`). Optional `href` / `note` on tiles. Never count loaded rows.
- Home KPIs are a different surface (`Query.home` extras). See `.cursor/rules/cpanel-supervisor-home.mdc`. Do not bind the customers directory header to home extras, and do not bind home tiles to `customerStats`.
- Shared `StatusChip` + visual helpers (`supervisor-shared-ui.md`). Nested org copy: مؤسسة not منظمة. Product: باقة = Plan, اشتراك = Subscription.
- i18n: `ar.ts` only; nested translator bind.
- Read-only directories: no new `DATA_ADAPTERS` or `Forms` keys. Plan catalog writes use `Forms.SUPERVISOR_PLAN` (exception; see `plan-management.md`).

## GQL mirrors

Command-copy from backend. Do not hand-edit `cpanel/src/types/gql/**`.
